---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="项目演示 — Eric Chen" description="Eric Chen 的新项目视频演示。">
  <section class="detail demo-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/#work">← 返回全部作品</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">PROJECT / VIDEO DEMO</p>
    <h1>项目演示<span class="accent">.</span></h1>
    <p class="detail-desc">新项目 · 视频演示</p>
    <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="新项目演示视频">
      <source src="/videos/project-demo-20260903.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      你的浏览器不支持视频播放。<a href="/videos/project-demo-20260903.mp4">打开视频文件</a>
    </video>
    <p class="video-note">点击播放，可拖动进度或全屏观看。</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .demo-page video { display:block; width:100%; max-height:75vh; background:#080a08; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; margin-top:32px; }
  .video-note {color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;margin-top:16px;}
</style>
